message: If you use these shaders, cite godot-vrm's MToon.
title: Godot-MToon-Shader (vendored from godot-vrm, unchanged)
abstract: >-
  The MToon toon shader of V-Sekai's godot-vrm, copied unchanged from
  addons/Godot-MToon-Shader at the commit below: the common include and the
  opaque, cull-off, cutout and transparent variants the station's renderer uses.
